=== each host gives the header its own reading
int host
  ### function `get_value`

  ---
  → `int`
  Not self-contained: each includer chooses VALUE_TYPE first.

  ---
  ```cpp
  int get_value()
  ```
  range: VALUE_TYPE ⟦get_value⟧();
real host
  ### function `get_value`

  ---
  → `float`
  Not self-contained: each includer chooses VALUE_TYPE first.

  ---
  ```cpp
  float get_value()
  ```
  range: VALUE_TYPE ⟦get_value⟧();
